  "document_id": "23.陈海峰（三访）20110816（一校后 阅读版）.docx",
  "interviewee": "陈海峰",
  "source_model_id": "cuc/deepseek",
  "source_prompt_version": "system-v0.3-frozen+window-v0.5",
  "task_scope": "归并同一文档的窗口候选，并区分个人经历、讲述背景和范围不确定项。",
  "dialogue_segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0003",
      "segment_order": 3,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：到现在,他这个全名英文的翻译都没有留下来，所以这个组织，希尔茨（音）等于是姓。这个就是苏北国际和平医院。实际上呢，当时我们收留了各个分区转来的七八百个病人，轻的一部分撤去，还有一二百，基本上都是县团以上的干部啊，在这里治疗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0004",
      "segment_order": 4,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "主要的呢，当时就空出床位来收“七战七捷”（的伤员）。因为“七战七捷”打了一个多月了，呖呖拉拉不断地有重伤员来。重伤员，前前后后呢，我们大概收了一千二百多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0006",
      "segment_order": 6,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：“七战七捷”一共四千多伤员。我们抽出了一个医疗队，就第三医疗队，李兰丁的这个医疗队呢，就去组建了转运站"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0007",
      "segment_order": 7,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "，就是从前线转到后方这个转运站，建立了华中军区的野战军转运站，抽调了原来18旅的一个卫生部长"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0008",
      "segment_order": 8,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "，老部长，后来当江苏省卫生厅长的，省里（音）当转运站的站长。这个转运伤员过程中间治疗呢、抢救呢，都由李兰丁这个医疗队负责。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0010",
      "segment_order": 10,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：这个伤员的野战（医院）叫医疗总站，华中野战军转运总站。下面呢，好多分站，根据每一个战役的需要，分站设在哪里，它流动的，分站比较艰苦一点。水网地区都是配备了船，就是讲的双篙双桨那种船。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0011",
      "segment_order": 11,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "就说要打海安了，靠近海安附近呢，设几个分站。要打李堡了，设几个分站。那分站到这个总转站，总转站再转到我们后方，转到这湖心寺来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0012",
      "segment_order": 12,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "都是用水路运输，那个时候都是水网地区，走水路就快，都（用）船只运输。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0014",
      "segment_order": 14,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：从苏中前线运到我们淮安呢，也有二三百里路了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0015",
      "segment_order": 15,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "作战地区啊，最近的话，就是在泰州附近呢，也有二百多里路，设了好多转运站。不归我们指挥，我们指挥不了。就是给他一个队，以后就没还给我们，这个队一直变成转运总站，以后到山东也是转运总站，变成华东军区转运总站了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0016",
      "segment_order": 16,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：后来这个转运站是常设的一个机构了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0017",
      "segment_order": 17,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：常设机构了，要打大仗就要转运站。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0018",
      "segment_order": 18,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：到淮海战役的时候，这个转运站就是大量上来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0019",
      "segment_order": 19,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：每一次都要用转运站了"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0020",
      "segment_order": 20,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "，每次打大仗都要转运站，所以变成常设机构了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0021",
      "segment_order": 21,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "原来没有，原来我们在江南是临时设。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0023",
      "segment_order": 23,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：苏浙军区，打天目山战役不是设了转运站嘛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0024",
      "segment_order": 24,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "在那个灵峰寺啊，有我们保健科长李甲光（音）啊，临时派一些人啊，在景坞里设立一个分站，在这个白水湾设了一个分站，三个站。从这个地方，今年来的，来了以后设转运站。使沿途的不脱离治疗，沿途的伤员都有照顾，转运过程中间，都有医务人员在身边。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0025",
      "segment_order": 25,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "这样子啊，减少死亡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0026",
      "segment_order": 26,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "减少残废。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0027",
      "segment_order": 27,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "这样子呢，保证这个战斗力，归队率就高了。所以这个转运系统，也是学的那个第二次世界大战中间。他们不叫转（运），叫什么不知道了，叫阶梯治疗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0028",
      "segment_order": 28,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "阶梯治疗实际上一节一节一节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0029",
      "segment_order": 29,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "分级治疗，分阶转运。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0030",
      "segment_order": 30,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：咱们实际上这个部队医疗正规化就（是）从国际和平医院开始的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0031",
      "segment_order": 31,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    陈海峰：欸，开始这样子来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH07-DOC02-S0032",
      "segment_order": 32,
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    "
    }
  ],
